= Francisco Largo Caballero

Largo Caballero is the secretary-general of the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span>, the largest federation of <span style="color: #c00000;">socialist</span> trade unions, and one of the towering figures of the workers' movement.

- @organizing
- @depression
- @root: Return to main

# Largo Caballero was one of the people who argued for union independence
#- @union_unity

@organizing
title: Organizing workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the workers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if wtb_adopted == 1; labor_strength += 2;

We have increased our organizing among the workers through the UGT.

@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to get us out of this mess.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the public-works plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 5; wtb_points += 15

[? if not wtb_concept: The UGT's economists have been drafting a public-works plan to pull the country out of the depression. Largo Caballero throws the union's weight behind it throughout the party and the labour movement. ?][? if wtb_concept: The public-works plan has been taken up as the unions' answer to the depression. Largo Caballero throws the UGT's weight behind it throughout the party and the labour movement. ?]

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 5; labor_strength += 5

We have reduced tensions with the UGT wing, and increased its strength in the party.
